{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "projectId": "ai-gold-rush",
  "channelId": "invisible-systems",
  "plannedScenes": [
    {
      "sceneId": "sc01",
      "chapterId": "ch1",
      "narrationText": "Deep inside an unmarked concrete facility in Northern Virginia, thirty thousand processors hum in unison. From the outside, the building resembles an anonymous logistics warehouse, surrounded by barbed wire, security checkpoints, and massive diesel backup generators.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 20,
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "data-center-3d",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "shot": "wide", "seed": 3, "pulse": true }
        },
        {
          "component": "title-card",
          "track": "overlay",
          "from": 2,
          "fadeIn": 0.5,
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "The Invisible Systems",
            "title": "The AI Gold Rush",
            "subtitle": "Who Controls the World's Computing Power?",
            "titleSize": 88
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc02",
      "chapterId": "ch1",
      "narrationText": "But inside, these halls pulse with the digital thoughts, generated synthetic media, and reasoning engines for hundreds of millions of people across the planet. This region, Loudoun County, is often called Data Center Alley.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 18,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "", "gridSize": 96 }
        },
        {
          "component": "world-map",
          "track": "main",
          "camera": { "fromScale": 1, "toScale": 1.25, "originX": 0.32, "originY": 0.38 },
          "props": {
            "showBorders": true,
            "routes": [
              { "from": "new-york", "to": "london", "label": "Atlantic Core", "startAt": 0.1, "growth": 0.4 }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "lower-third",
          "track": "overlay",
          "from": 3,
          "duration": 9,
          "props": {
            "primary": "Loudoun County, Virginia",
            "secondary": "Capital of Global Internet Infrastructure"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc03",
      "chapterId": "ch1",
      "narrationText": "More than seventy percent of the world's daily internet traffic flows through these windowless structures. In less than three decades, quiet farmland has been transformed into the densest concentration of computing power ever assembled in human history.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 19,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "data-center-3d",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "shot": "aisle", "seed": 7, "pulse": true }
        },
        {
          "component": "callout",
          "track": "overlay",
          "from": 2.5,
          "duration": 12,
          "props": {
            "kicker": "70% of Global Traffic",
            "text": "Over 25 million square feet of hyperscale data centers operational in a single county.",
            "position": "bottom-left"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc04",
      "chapterId": "ch1",
      "narrationText": "When modern artificial intelligence arrived, it did not descend from an ethereal cloud. It took root in these concrete foundations, demanding more electricity, more cold water, and more physical silicon than any previous technological revolution.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 20,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "cross-zoom", "duration": 0.7 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "", "gridSize": 0 }
        },
        {
          "component": "kinetic-text",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "text": "Artificial intelligence did *not* descend from a cloud. It took root in concrete.",
            "size": 60
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc05",
      "chapterId": "ch1",
      "narrationText": "When ChatGPT launched in late 2022, it crossed one hundred million monthly active users in just sixty days. By comparison, it took Instagram two and a half years, and Spotify more than three years to reach that same threshold.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 22,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        { "component": "backdrop", "track": "background", "props": { "glow": "" } },
        {
          "component": "bar-chart",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "title": "Days Required to Reach 100 Million Users",
            "bars": [
              { "label": "ChatGPT", "value": 60, "highlight": true },
              { "label": "TikTok", "value": 270 },
              { "label": "Instagram", "value": 910 },
              { "label": "Spotify", "value": 1278 }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc06",
      "chapterId": "ch1",
      "narrationText": "The world had never adopted a consumer technology with such ferocious speed, catching global telecommunications and electric grid infrastructure entirely unprepared.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 19,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        { "component": "backdrop", "track": "background", "props": { "glow": "" } },
        {
          "component": "stat-block",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "Adoption Shockwave",
            "locale": "en-US",
            "stats": [
              { "value": 100, "suffix": "M", "label": "active users" },
              { "value": 60, "suffix": " days", "label": "to global scale" },
              { "value": 0, "suffix": " warning", "label": "for power grids" }
            ],
            "source": "UBS Global Research / Company Filings"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc07",
      "chapterId": "ch2",
      "narrationText": "To understand where this power comes from, follow the physical path of a single query. When you type a question into an artificial intelligence model, your prompt does not rest inside your phone or your browser.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 20,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "", "gridSize": 64 }
        },
        {
          "component": "kinetic-text",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "text": "Your prompt does *not* stay on your phone. It moves across the earth.",
            "size": 58
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc08",
      "chapterId": "ch2",
      "narrationText": "It is converted into mathematical token vectors and launched across the global grid. In less than fifty milliseconds, your data travels through underground fiber optic conduits, passes through carrier-neutral internet exchanges, and arrives at the security perimeter of a hyperscale computing campus.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 21,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "cross-zoom", "duration": 0.7 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "world-map",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "showBorders": true,
            "routes": [
              { "from": "new-york", "to": "london", "startAt": 0.05, "growth": 0.35 },
              { "from": "fortaleza", "to": "lisbon", "startAt": 0.2, "growth": 0.3 },
              { "from": "singapore", "to": "mumbai", "startAt": 0.4, "growth": 0.35 }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "lower-third",
          "track": "overlay",
          "from": 2,
          "duration": 12,
          "props": {
            "primary": "Sub-50ms Transit",
            "secondary": "Underground fiber optic conduits and IXP peering points"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc09",
      "chapterId": "ch2",
      "narrationText": "Inside the facility, high-throughput network switches route the packet directly to a synchronized GPU cluster. Two entirely different computational worlds exist here: the training cluster, where colossal frontier models spend months learning from trillions of tokens, and the inference cluster, where billions of individual daily queries are answered in fractions of a second.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 23,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "node-graph",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "title": "Dual Computing Architecture",
            "layout": "flow",
            "nodes": [
              { "id": "prompt", "label": "User Query", "sub": "vector token", "rank": 0 },
              { "id": "switch", "label": "Network Fabric", "sub": "800 Gbps switch", "rank": 1 },
              { "id": "train", "label": "Training Cluster", "sub": "30k GPUs (months)", "rank": 2, "highlight": false },
              { "id": "infer", "label": "Inference Cluster", "sub": "active response (ms)", "rank": 2, "highlight": true },
              { "id": "out", "label": "Stream Output", "sub": "back to user", "rank": 3 }
            ],
            "edges": [
              { "from": "prompt", "to": "switch" },
              { "from": "switch", "to": "train" },
              { "from": "switch", "to": "infer" },
              { "from": "infer", "to": "out" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc10",
      "chapterId": "ch2",
      "narrationText": "This entire round trip—from your fingers, through thousands of miles of glass fiber, into the silicon die, and back to your screen—takes less than three hundred milliseconds.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 18,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.5 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "stat-block",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "Speed of Thought",
            "locale": "en-US",
            "stats": [
              { "value": 300, "suffix": " ms", "label": "round-trip latency" },
              { "value": 3000, "suffix": " km", "label": "average physical path" }
            ],
            "source": "Global Network Latency Telemetry"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc11",
      "chapterId": "ch3",
      "narrationText": "The basic unit of modern artificial intelligence is no longer the server. It is the high-density computing rack. Inside each vertical chassis sits a cluster of eight specialized graphics processing units, interconnected by proprietary high-speed copper and optical links.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 19,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "data-center-3d",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "shot": "rack", "seed": 11, "pulse": false }
        },
        {
          "component": "lower-third",
          "track": "overlay",
          "from": 2,
          "duration": 10,
          "props": {
            "primary": "Hyperscale Compute Rack",
            "secondary": "8x Accelerated Processing Units with NVLink Fabric"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc12",
      "chapterId": "ch3",
      "narrationText": "A single modern AI server rack draws over forty kilowatts of continuous electricity. That is enough electrical energy to power more than thirty average American homes simultaneously, concentrated entirely within a footprint smaller than a standard refrigerator.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 22,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "stat-block",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "Power Density Surge",
            "locale": "en-US",
            "stats": [
              { "value": 40, "suffix": " kW", "label": "per single rack" },
              { "value": 32, "label": "homes powered equivalent" },
              { "value": 1.2, "suffix": " m²", "decimals": 1, "label": "physical footprint" }
            ],
            "source": "Uptime Institute Data Center Survey"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc13",
      "chapterId": "ch3",
      "narrationText": "Within this tight vertical enclosure, processors exchange intermediate mathematical tensors at over nine hundred gigabytes per second. If the network experiences even microsecond-level latency or packet drops, thousands of interconnected chips stall, wasting thousands of dollars of compute time every minute.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 21,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "cross-zoom", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "bar-chart",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "title": "Interconnect Bandwidth (GB/s)",
            "bars": [
              { "label": "NVLink Switch Fabric", "value": 900, "highlight": true },
              { "label": "PCIe Gen 5 x16", "value": 128 },
              { "label": "InfiniBand Quantum", "value": 50 },
              { "label": "10 Gigabit Ethernet", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc14",
      "chapterId": "ch3",
      "narrationText": "These machines represent the most complex and capital-intensive manufacturing achievement in human civilization. And they are completely dependent on an unbroken stream of physical resources.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 19,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.9 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "", "gridSize": 0 }
        },
        {
          "component": "kinetic-text",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "text": "The most *capital-intensive* machine in human civilization.",
            "size": 62
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc15",
      "chapterId": "ch4",
      "narrationText": "When electricity enters a semiconductor chip, almost all of it is converted directly into heat. As modern accelerators push past one thousand watts per processor die, the laws of thermodynamics impose an inescapable physical ceiling.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 20,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "data-center-3d",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "shot": "macro", "seed": 23, "pulse": false }
        },
        {
          "component": "callout",
          "track": "overlay",
          "from": 2,
          "duration": 12,
          "props": {
            "kicker": "The Thermal Limit",
            "text": "1,000 watts dissipated in a piece of silicon the size of a postage stamp.",
            "position": "bottom-right"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc16",
      "chapterId": "ch4",
      "narrationText": "Air cooling—the historical practice of blowing chilled air across aluminum heat sinks—has reached its theoretical limit. Air simply cannot absorb heat quickly enough from modern silicon dies without requiring fans that consume more power than the chips themselves.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 21,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "cross-zoom", "duration": 0.7 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "diagram",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "parts": [
              { "x": 0.5, "y": 0.35, "label": "Accelerator Die", "sub": "1,000 W thermal output", "side": "right" },
              { "x": 0.38, "y": 0.55, "label": "Air Cooling Limit", "sub": "Thermal boundary reached", "side": "left" },
              { "x": 0.62, "y": 0.72, "label": "Fan Power Spike", "sub": "Consumes >30% server power", "side": "right" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc17",
      "chapterId": "ch4",
      "narrationText": "To survive thermal collapse, data centers are re-engineering their entire internal plumbing. High-purity chilled liquid must be pumped directly across copper cold plates mounted to the silicon surface, carrying megawatts of heat away to massive external cooling towers.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 22,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "cable-3d",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "layers": 4, "travelFrom": 0.1, "travelTo": 0.7, "cutawayAt": 0.4 }
        },
        {
          "component": "tech-panel",
          "track": "overlay",
          "props": {
            "title": "Coolant Distribution Telemetry",
            "rows": [
              { "label": "Coolant Flow Rate", "value": "1,450 L/min", "state": "normal" },
              { "label": "Fluid Supply Temp", "value": "18.4 °C", "state": "normal" },
              { "label": "Fluid Return Temp", "value": "39.2 °C", "state": "warn" },
              { "label": "Thermal Margin", "value": "3.1 °C to throttle", "state": "warn" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc18",
      "chapterId": "ch4",
      "narrationText": "On peak summer afternoons, a single hyperscale campus can evaporate millions of gallons of water every day just to prevent its processors from melting. The ethereal mind of artificial intelligence is bound directly to the municipal water supply.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 21,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "bar-chart",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "title": "Daily Water Evaporation per Campus (Million Gallons)",
            "bars": [
              { "label": "Peak Summer AI Facility", "value": 3.8, "highlight": true },
              { "label": "Average Hyperscale Campus", "value": 1.9 },
              { "label": "City of 50,000 Residents", "value": 5.0 }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc19",
      "chapterId": "ch4",
      "narrationText": "Every computing cluster is fundamentally a thermal machine, constrained not by human ambition, but by how fast boiling heat can be rejected into the surrounding atmosphere.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 17,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "", "gridSize": 0 }
        },
        {
          "component": "kinetic-text",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "text": "Every computing cluster is fundamentally a *thermal machine*.",
            "size": 60
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc20",
      "chapterId": "ch5",
      "narrationText": "Building and operating this planetary physical footprint requires capital on a scale that only a handful of corporations on Earth can command. Today, three corporate giants—Amazon Web Services, Microsoft Azure, and Google Cloud—control roughly sixty-five percent of the worldwide cloud infrastructure market.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 22,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "bar-chart",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "title": "Global Cloud Infrastructure Market Share (%)",
            "bars": [
              { "label": "Amazon Web Services", "value": 32, "highlight": true },
              { "label": "Microsoft Azure", "value": 21, "highlight": true },
              { "label": "Google Cloud", "value": 12, "highlight": true },
              { "label": "All Other Providers", "value": 35 }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc21",
      "chapterId": "ch5",
      "narrationText": "These three hyperscalers do not merely rent server time to software companies. They dictate the supply chain. They design custom application-specific integrated circuits, construct private transatlantic submarine cables, and finance dedicated power substations.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 21,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "cross-zoom", "duration": 0.7 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "stat-block",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "Vertical Integration",
            "locale": "en-US",
            "stats": [
              { "value": 65, "suffix": "%", "label": "global cloud control" },
              { "value": 120, "suffix": "B", "prefix": "$", "label": "annual capital expenditure" },
              { "value": 3, "label": "deciding corporations" }
            ],
            "source": "Synergy Research Group / Q3 2026"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc22",
      "chapterId": "ch5",
      "narrationText": "To secure future capacity, these tech conglomerates are now contracting entire output streams from nuclear power stations and geothermal reservoirs. If computing power is the oil of the twenty-first century, these three corporations own the wells, the pipelines, the refineries, and the distribution grid.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 22,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "world-map",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "showBorders": true,
            "routes": [
              { "from": "new-york", "to": "london", "label": "Dedicated Energy PPA", "growth": 0.4 },
              { "from": "fortaleza", "to": "lisbon", "label": "Transatlantic Subsea Cable", "growth": 0.3 }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "callout",
          "track": "overlay",
          "from": 2,
          "duration": 12,
          "props": {
            "kicker": "Nuclear Power Restart",
            "text": "835 MW contracted directly from Three Mile Island Unit 1 for 20 continuous years.",
            "position": "bottom-left"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc23",
      "chapterId": "ch5",
      "narrationText": "Startups and independent researchers may develop novel model architectures, but every frontier system must ultimately be trained and hosted on infrastructure owned by these corporate gatekeepers.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 20,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "node-graph",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "title": "The Gatekeeper Chokepoint",
            "layout": "radial",
            "nodes": [
              { "id": "big3", "label": "Hyperscale Cloud", "sub": "AWS / Azure / GCP", "highlight": true },
              { "id": "model", "label": "Frontier Model Labs" },
              { "id": "research", "label": "Academic Researchers" },
              { "id": "startups", "label": "AI Startups" },
              { "id": "users", "label": "Enterprise Users" }
            ],
            "edges": [
              { "from": "big3", "to": "model" },
              { "from": "big3", "to": "research" },
              { "from": "big3", "to": "startups" },
              { "from": "big3", "to": "users" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc24",
      "chapterId": "ch5",
      "narrationText": "The promise of decentralized digital intelligence has run directly into the physical reality of centralized corporate power.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 18,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "dip-to-black", "duration": 0.8 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "", "gridSize": 0 }
        },
        {
          "component": "kinetic-text",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "text": "Decentralized intelligence meets *centralized physical power*.",
            "size": 60
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc25",
      "chapterId": "ch6",
      "narrationText": "Every query generated has an unavoidable physical weight. A single complex reasoning interaction with a frontier large language model consumes approximately 3.2 watt-hours of electrical energy—more than ten times the power required for an ordinary web search.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 22,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "fade", "duration": 0.6 },
      "layers": [
        {
          "component": "backdrop",
          "track": "background",
          "props": { "glow": "" }
        },
        {
          "component": "bar-chart",
          "track": "main",
          "props": {
            "title": "Watt-Hours Consumed per Single Interaction",
            "bars": [
              { "label": "Frontier AI Query", "value": 3.2, "highlight": true },
              { "label": "Traditional Web Search", "value": 0.3 },
              { "label": "LED Bulb (1 minute)", "value": 0.15 },
              { "label": "Smartphone Full Charge", "value": 14.0 }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "sc26",
      "chapterId": "ch6",
      "narrationText": "When multiplied across billions of daily interactions, artificial intelligence ceases to be purely ethereal software. It becomes a relentless mechanical engine whose gears consume national power grids, river basins, and scarce mineral deposits.",
      "estimatedDurationSeconds": 21,
      "transitionIn": { "type": "cross-zoom", "duration": 0.7 },
